# AI Contribution Log

## Project

BFS vs DFS Performance Analysis

## AI Tool Used

ChatGPT

## Purpose of AI Assistance

AI was used as a learning and development assistance tool during the project.

## AI Contributions

1. Explained the concepts of Breadth-First Search (BFS) and Depth-First Search (DFS).
2. Helped structure the BFS and DFS programs.
3. Helped create a suitable 15-node graph for the experiment.
4. Explained how to count expanded nodes.
5. Explained the use of the py-spy profiling tool.
6. Helped prepare the py-spy commands for BFS and DFS.
7. Helped prepare the profiling program for measuring execution time.
8. Helped organize the profiling results into a comparison table.
9. Helped explain the obtained results.
10. Helped structure the SLE-2 report and README file.

## Work Performed by Student

1. Created the GitHub repository.
2. Created and modified the Python files.
3. Implemented and ran the BFS and DFS programs.
4. Created the 15-node graph.
5. Installed py-spy.
6. Executed the BFS and DFS programs.
7. Ran the profiling commands.
8. Generated bfs_profile.svg.
9. Generated dfs_profile.svg.
10. Ran profiling.py to obtain the actual average execution times.
11. Verified the paths and number of nodes expanded.
12. Verified the py-spy samples and errors.
13. Committed the project files using Git.
14. Pushed the final project to GitHub.

